{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_03_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_03","title":"意外之旅","storyCode":"GT-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"93d45f108c0d004420592def775cc12478fc385744d71720db1a4b83cd31f04f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"交戰中大鮑勃意外負傷，腿部結晶暴露了他是感染者的事實。而格拉尼完全不在意，為大鮑勃進行包紮。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"幹掉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"大鮑勃，你沒事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？你腿上的傷口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有漏網的！可能是瓦各斯克團的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"這個我自己能處理！先擊退敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這小個子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂，你那是什麼眼神？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別過來，不怕我在你身上開個窟窿嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你都解決了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"真厲害。這麼小的個子，本事倒是不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"坐在那裡別動。我來給你包紮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不礙事，讓我起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到我身上的結晶了吧？你難道想被感染嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，本來就是我們羅德島的救助對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島是......？不是維多利亞......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"以前是維多利亞的騎警，不過現在，是羅德島的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"離我遠一點，小姑娘。我是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾小姐，這可能有點血腥，你稍稍回避下吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，已經止血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你經常給感染者這麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同事有很多都感染了礦石病，但我分不出究竟有誰感染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"也就洗澡的時候能看得出來吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"——哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你了，沒戒心的小個子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]}]}
